481
00:27:36.364 --> 00:27:37.948
PANGGILAN TERLEWATKAN
JAE-YOON MANIS

482
00:27:38.115 --> 00:27:39.742
PANGGILAN GAGAL
JAE-YOON MANIS

483
00:27:40.284 --> 00:27:44.245
