484
00:27:44.246 --> 00:27:46.832
[Paolo] Ah! Kami benar-benar terkepung.

485
00:27:47.666 --> 00:27:49.126
Ah! Oh!

486
00:27:52.797 --> 00:27:54.131
- Oh, Paolo! Oh.
- Hah?

487
00:27:54.673 --> 00:27:56.384
- Paolo, di mana senjatamu?
- Senjata?

488
00:27:57.009 --> 00:27:58.385
